	"f2p_sc_ot_mirei_1": "The lease, signed twice",
	"f2p_sc_ot_mirei_2": "Golden hour on the top floor",
	"f2p_sc_ot_dan_1": "Green build, late night",
	"f2p_sc_ot_dan_2": "The spare mug",
	"f2p_sc_ot_priya_1": "The corridor light",
	"f2p_sc_ot_priya_2": "Sunset on the roof",
	"f2p_sc_ot_mara_1": "Four corners",
	"f2p_sc_ot_mara_2": "Off the clock",
	"f2p_sc_ot_wes_1": "Moving day",
	"f2p_sc_ot_wes_2": "The couch on seven",
	"f2p_sc_ot_nia_1": "Off the books",
	"f2p_sc_ot_nia_2": "The blazer comes off",
	"f2p_sc_ot_sol_1": "Late edition",
	"f2p_sc_ot_sol_2": "Stop the presses",
	"f2p_sc_ot_b2": "The glass office",
	"f2p_sc_ot_b3": "Floor nine",
	"f2p_sc_ot_b4": "The quiet floor",
	"f2p_sc_ot_b5": "Keys to the city",
	"f2p_tier_mirei_1": "Twelve years I ran Voss's street and never once had a building that was mine to worry about. I'm not sure I remember how. Show me the fuse box and I'll start there.",
	"f2p_tier_mirei_2": "I fixed the lights on four before you asked. Old habit. Then I realised nobody was going to thank Voss for it this time. You did. Stay for one drink after close.",
	"f2p_tier_mirei_4": "I used to watch this street from Voss's office and think it was his. It's ours now, floor by floor. Some nights I stay on the top floor just to see it lit. Come up after close; the view's better with two.",
	"f2p_tier_dan_1": "You drink the coffee from the fourth-floor machine too? Brave. We should start a support group.",
	"f2p_tier_dan_2": "The build went green at 3 a.m. and you were the only other person here to see it. That counts for something.",
	"f2p_tier_dan_4": "I keep a spare mug in my desk. It's yours now, apparently. I didn't decide that; it just happened.",
	"f2p_tier_priya_1": "My last firm wouldn't sign off my hours. Said I wasn't ready. I've rewired half this floor since breakfast, so either they were wrong or I'm very lucky.",
	"f2p_tier_priya_2": "You let me run the whole third floor myself. Nobody's ever handed me a whole floor. I checked every circuit twice, then once more for fun. Come up on the roof sometime; I'll show you the good ledge.",
	"f2p_tier_priya_4": "I passed my master's exam this morning. First try. I wore Dad's hard hat to it. I keep a thermos on the roof for sunsets. It's a two-person thermos. I checked.",
	"f2p_tier_mara_1": "At my last building I reported the boiler three times. When it caught, they blamed the person who reported it. So. I sign the fire log correctly. Every time.",
	"f2p_tier_mara_2": "You read my reports. All of them. Nobody reads the reports. I'm reconsidering my opinion of you, and I don't do that often.",
	"f2p_tier_mara_4": "Kaminski asked me to train the inspectors on the east side. Me. The one they blamed. I made you a copy of the roof key. It's not an access card. It's a key. There's a difference.",
	"f2p_tier_wes_1": "I have a meeting at midnight. With whom? With you, now. Consider it scheduled.",
	"f2p_tier_wes_2": "Nia says I talk too much. You don't seem to mind. That's either kindness or bad hearing, and I'll take either.",
	"f2p_tier_wes_4": "I found a couch nobody's claimed on seven. I'm claiming it. For two. Don't tell Nia; she'll audit it.",
	"f2p_tier_nia_1": "I flagged a client's books at my old firm. The client was Pike Harlan. The firm kept the client and let me go. Your figures reconcile, by the way. It's very restful.",
	"f2p_tier_nia_2": "I'd stopped trusting my own numbers. You asked me to check yours and then actually listened. I could kiss you. Professionally speaking, I won't. Yet.",
	"f2p_tier_nia_4": "Three firms called this week, now the Meridian audit's in the papers. I told them I'm busy. I don't take the blazer off at work, not for anyone. Just so you know what it means when I do.",
	"f2p_tier_sol_1": "The paper folded eight years ago, and my editor said nobody reads long stories any more. I still file at four. You're the first person who's asked to read it.",
	"f2p_tier_sol_2": "I wrote a column about this street. You're in paragraph three. The Harbour Courier wants to run it: my first byline in eight years. You come off well. I'm biased.",
	"f2p_tier_sol_4": "Page one, above the fold, my name. I read it on the tram and nobody knew it was me, and I didn't care. Stop the presses, I said, out loud, when you walked in. Sit down.",
	"f2p_ev_ev_audit_title": "Audit Week",
